{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "2845c671-9de2-4e92-bad8-4d700d22f9f8",
    "name": "DF-11 - Responsable Temporal (boundary bug)",
    "description": "Coleccion para reproducir y verificar el bug reportado en DF-11: un responsable temporal no puede iniciar una accion el ultimo dia de su asignacion (responsable_temporal_hasta), recibiendo 403 Forbidden en vez del 200 esperado.\n\nAntes de correr:\n1. Define collection variable 'base_url' con el subdominio del tenant de pruebas (ej. http://demo.localhost:8000).\n2. Define 'admin_email' / 'admin_password' de un usuario admin del tenant.\n3. Define 'temp_user_email' / 'temp_user_password' de un usuario que se usara como responsable temporal.\n4. Ejecuta 'Login admin', luego 'Crear accion abierta' (o usa un accion_id existente en estado 'abierto') y 'Asignar responsable temporal (hasta = hoy)'.\n5. Ejecuta 'Login responsable temporal' y luego 'Transicion a en_proceso (repro bug)'.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "10411939",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/10411939-2845c671-9de2-4e92-bad8-4d700d22f9f8?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Login admin",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const data = pm.response.json();",
              "if (data.access) { pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_token', data.access); }",
              "pm.test('login admin OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login/",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "auth",
            "login",
            ""
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Asignar responsable temporal (hasta = hoy)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const now = new Date();",
              "const today = `${now.getFullYear()}-${String(now.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0')}-${String(now.getDate()).padStart(2, '0')}`;",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('today', today);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('asignacion OK (200)', () => pm.response.code === 200);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"responsable_temporal_id\": {{temp_user_id}},\n  \"responsable_temporal_hasta\": \"{{today}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/acciones/{{accion_id}}/responsable-temporal/",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "acciones",
            "{{accion_id}}",
            "responsable-temporal",
            ""
          ]
        },
        "description": "La pre-solicitud calcula automaticamente la fecha local de hoy en formato YYYY-MM-DD y la guarda en la variable 'today'."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Login responsable temporal",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const data = pm.response.json();",
              "if (data.access) { pm.collectionVariables.set('temp_token', data.access); }",
              "pm.test('login temporal OK', () => pm.response.code === 200);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{temp_user_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{temp_user_password}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login/",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "auth",
            "login",
            ""
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Transicion a en_proceso (repro bug DF-11)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('DF-11 corregido: 200 esperado, no 403', () => pm.response.code === 200);",
              "if (pm.response.code === 403) { console.warn('Reproducido: 403 Forbidden en el ultimo dia de asignacion temporal (DF-11).'); }"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{temp_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"estado\": \"en_proceso\",\n  \"comentario\": \"Repro DF-11: intento el ultimo dia de la asignacion temporal\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/acciones/{{accion_id}}/transition/",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "acciones",
            "{{accion_id}}",
            "transition",
            ""
          ]
        },
        "description": "Esperado: 200 OK (el responsable temporal sigue vigente el dia 'hasta'). Con el bug: 403 Forbidden."
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://demo.localhost:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_email",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_password",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "temp_user_email",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "temp_user_password",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "temp_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "accion_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "temp_user_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "today",
      "value": ""
    }
  ]
}
